# Development Instructions

## Docker Restart Protocol
After every code change to the backend, restart Docker WITHOUT volumes:

Use the full path to the docker-compose.yml file (since Windows CMD doesn't support `cd dir && command`):

```bash
docker-compose -f backend/docker-compose.yml down
docker-compose -f backend/docker-compose.yml up --build -d
```

**DO NOT** use the `-v` flag with `docker-compose down` (i.e., avoid `docker-compose down -v`), as that would delete the database volume and require re-running `init_db.py`.